  "content": [
    {
      "text": "hear report of thee, and shall tremble, Deut. 2:25. earth trembled, and the heavens dropped, Judg. 5:4. earth shook and trembled, 2 Sam. 22:8 (Ps. 18:7; 77:18). assembled unto me every one that trembled at the words of the God, Ezra 9:4. shaketh the earth … the pillars thereof tremble, Job 9:6. Thou hast made the earth to tremble, Ps. 60:2. Tremble, thou earth, at the presence of the Lord, Ps. 114:7. man that made the earth to tremble, Isa. 14:16 (2 Ne. 24:16). Tremble, ye women that are at ease, Isa. 32:11. that the nations may tremble at thy presence, Isa. 64:2. Hear the word of the Lord, ye that tremble at his word, Isa. 66:5. saith the Lord: will ye not tremble at my presence, Jer. 5:22. Lord … at his wrath the earth shall tremble, Jer. 10:10. men tremble and fear before the God of Daniel, Dan. 6:26. heavens shall tremble, Joel 2:10.",
